  "post_content": "<p>Esta tarde han finalizado en el auditorio de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Onda las audiciones de m&uacute;sica de c&aacute;mara de alumnado de ense&ntilde;anzas profesionales del Centro de Estudios Musicales, que se iniciaron ayer.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/06/IMG_0709.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Bajo la direcci&oacute;n del profesor Jos&eacute; Antonio Cavero, han ido subiendo al escenario diferentes grupos de c&aacute;mara que han interpretado composiciones de Mazas, Telemann, Hofmeister y Mozart.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonaaudiciomusicacambrauniomusical/img_0696.jpg\" alt=\"img_0696\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonaaudiciomusicacambrauniomusical/img_0697.jpg\" alt=\"img_0697\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonaaudiciomusicacambrauniomusical/img_0698.jpg\" alt=\"img_0698\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonaaudiciomusicacambrauniomusical/img_0699.jpg\" alt=\"img_0699\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonaaudiciomusicacambrauniomusical/img_0700.jpg\" alt=\"img_0700\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonaaudiciomusicacambrauniomusical/img_0701.jpg\" alt=\"img_0701\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonaaudiciomusicacambrauniomusical/img_0702.jpg\" alt=\"img_0702\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonaaudiciomusicacambrauniomusical/img_0703.jpg\" alt=\"img_0703\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonaaudiciomusicacambrauniomusical/img_0704.jpg\" alt=\"img_0704\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonaaudiciomusicacambrauniomusical/img_0705.jpg\" alt=\"img_0705\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonaaudiciomusicacambrauniomusical/img_0706.jpg\" alt=\"img_0706\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonaaudiciomusicacambrauniomusical/img_0707.jpg\" alt=\"img_0707\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
